        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d0eecbd1-69ca-4ed2-8371-a0568e710ea8\",\"review_text\":\"It's very bad it's not logging in my any mobile I have tried 3 different mobile number than also it is saying check your number resso is much much better than Spotify I will recommend to go with resso\"},{\"review_id\":\"079fbaa4-0e46-4fbe-8f36-d575c03eb02a\",\"review_text\":\"This is so nice i love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"31e13ab9-4a81-4d76-ae43-14d1bf25fa3d\",\"review_text\":\"I love to listen songs in spotify but after their october update its get worse app ever i have used....\"},{\"review_id\":\"96ff70cc-4cc4-4f1b-9b33-cd0e99d86fe9\",\"review_text\":\"Useless app I have ever seen\"},{\"review_id\":\"14225275-bf6c-480a-80eb-71c269754c04\",\"review_text\":\"You can't forward song without subscription yukkkkk uninstall Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"afeb9574-a2cd-4d70-9a5a-7401ae5677e8\",\"review_text\":\"This is a great app, over all there are no bugs and for me no ads (I dont even have premium). One thing I need to say is there is no way that you can fast forward and rewind songs I wish you can make adjustments for this.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4b2b5580-d37a-42f8-a33e-2c2cebb7862c\",\"review_text\":\"Just love it!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"fd8c6b97-7155-491c-bcf5-2f7dd289d2a6\",\"review_text\":\"Many popular song are not in this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"5caa9852-09b5-4a86-9a50-ba9417d75134\",\"review_text\":\"Love this app! I don't like that you can't download individual songs anymore, but it's still an amazing app!\"},{\"review_id\":\"1ce0584e-93d4-478e-9efd-6d524b223a0f\",\"review_text\":\"Best♡( ◜‿◝ )♡\"}]}"
